		scope: "Do not treat a cultural account, an older speech or this summary as a supply-specific legal conclusion. The separate Water Services Act supplier duty to give effect to Te Mana o te Wai was removed in 2025; current drinking-water safety duties continue. Ask the relevant council and mana whenua about local freshwater decisions, and Taumata Arowai about unclear drinking-water supplier requirements.",
